    "description": {
      "value": "Depicting a majestic dragon in flight, this tattoo imparts the endurance and majesty of those powerful creatures. You gain resistance 5 to the damage type matching the dragon your tattoo depicts.\n\n- Black or Copper Acid\n- Blue or Bronze Electricity\n- Brass, Gold, or Red Fire\n- Green Poison\n- Silver or White Cold\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nThe tattoo casts dragon wings on you. You can add the dragon claws benefit only if you know that focus spell and spend 1 Focus Point when you Activate the tattoo."
